# cleft — Stack & Project Structure

> **cleft** is a full-stack bill-splitting app for group outings (bars, dinners, parties).  
> Theme: **Purple Noir** — dark surfaces (`#08051a`), brand purple (`#6327FF`), bright body text (`#D4C4FF`), white numbers (`#FFFFFF`).

---

## 1. Technology Stack & Deployment

### 1.1 Local Development

#### Frontend (`frontend/`)

| Layer | Technology | Version (approx.) | Role |
|-------|------------|-------------------|------|
| Framework | **Next.js** (App Router) | 16.x | File-based routing, client-heavy pages |
| UI library | **React** | 19.x | Component model, client interactivity |
| Styling | **Tailwind CSS** | 3.4.x | Utility-first CSS, design tokens, responsive layout |
| Data fetching | **TanStack React Query** | 5.x | Auth session, profile, history, confirm mutations |
| HTTP client | **Axios** | 1.7.x | REST to NestJS with `credentials: true` (cookies) |
| Charts | **Recharts** | 2.x | Donut chart on embedded home dashboard |
| Language | **TypeScript** | 5.6.x | Types across pages, hooks, shared libs |

**Responsive / mobile**

- `viewportFit: cover` + safe-area padding on header, body, toasts
- `100dvh` min-height; horizontal scroll nav (`nav-scroll`) on narrow screens
- Grids: 1 → 2 → 3 columns; touch-friendly button padding

#### Backend (`backend/`)

