| **NestJS** 12.x | REST API modules (auth, users, party) |
| **Prisma** 5.x + **PostgreSQL** 16.x | Users, parties, items, history |
| **Passport.js** | Google OAuth 2.0 + JWT (httpOnly cookie) |
| **class-validator** | DTO validation |

