### 1.2 Production Deployment

```
┌──────────────┐     HTTPS + cookies      ┌──────────────────┐
│   Vercel     │ ───────────────────────► │  Render.com      │
│  (Frontend)  │   NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL    │  (NestJS API)    │
└──────────────┘                          └────────┬─────────┘
                                                 │ Prisma
                                                 ▼
                                        ┌──────────────────┐
                                        │    Supabase      │
                                        │  PostgreSQL 16   │
                                        │  (Singapore)     │
                                        └──────────────────┘
```

#### Frontend deployment (`frontend/`) → **Vercel** (Free Tier)

| Layer | Technology | Version | Production host & role |
|-------|------------|---------|------------------------|
| Framework | **Next.js** (App Router) | 16.x | **Vercel Edge Network** — serverless deployment, fast static generation, file-based routing |
| Styling | **Tailwind CSS** | 3.4.x | Design tokens & classes compiled and optimized at build time |
| Data fetching | **TanStack React Query** | 5.x | Manages auth session cache, history, and party mutation states |
| HTTP client | **Axios** | 1.7.x | Points to production Render API URL with `withCredentials: true` |

**Vercel env:** `NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://<service>.onrender.com`

#### Backend deployment (`backend/`) → **Render.com** (Free Web Service only)

| Layer | Technology | Version | Production host & role |
|-------|------------|---------|------------------------|
| API framework | **NestJS** | 12.x | **Render Free Web Service** — REST API. **$0/mo** but spins down after ~15 min idle (cold start ~30–60s) |
| ORM | **Prisma** | 5.x | Built during Render deploy; `DATABASE_URL` → Supabase |
| Auth security | **Passport.js** | — | Google OAuth + JWT in HttpOnly cookies (`SameSite: none`, `Secure: true`) |

**Critical:** Instance Type must be **Free**, not Starter (~$7/mo). Service name in Blueprint: `cleft-api`.  
See `DEPLOY.md` Phase 0 (delete old Starter service) before fresh deploy.

**Never on Render free path:** Starter instance, Persistent Disk, Render Postgres.

#### Database & storage → **Supabase** (Free Tier)

| Component | Technology | Production host & role |
|-----------|------------|------------------------|
| Database | **PostgreSQL** 16.x | **Supabase managed DB** — relational cloud storage for Users, Parties, and Items. **Singapore region** for lowest latency to TH users |

**Notes (free-only)**

- Slip images → `./uploads` on Render ephemeral disk (may disappear on redeploy)
- Cross-origin auth: HTTPS + `COOKIE_SAME_SITE=none` — see `DEPLOY.md`
- Full fresh-deploy checklist: `DEPLOY.md` (Phase 0–5)

