## 5. Application Screens

### Home (`/`) — public

**Guest (logged out):** ultra-clean welcome card only — logo, tagline, Login with Google. Session stats, history, and dashboard are hidden.

**Logged in:**

1. **Current session** — total spend + item count (from `usePartySession` + profile currency)
2. **Members** — member count + names preview
3. **Recent history** — API grid when logged in
4. **Embedded dashboard** (`DashboardSection`, `id="dashboard"`) — donut chart, who pays, % bars

### Profile menu (top-right dropdown)

| Feature | Behavior |
|---------|----------|
| Avatar | File upload → base64 preview → saved via `PATCH /users/profile` |
| Username | Editable text field |
| Currency | e.g. `THB` — shown on Home session card |
| Save profile | `PATCH /users/profile`, invalidates React Query cache |
| Login | Redirect `GET /auth/google` |
| Logout | `POST /auth/logout`, clears query cache + `cleft-session` |

Click outside closes menu. Guest sees Login only.

### Items (`/items`)

- List cards with name, note badge, line total, unit price
- **Edit** — inline form on same card (Save / Cancel)
- **Add item** — toggle expandable form at bottom
- Toasts on create/update/delete

### Members (`/members`)

- Row: avatar initial, **click name** → toggle edit panel (slide/fade animation)
- **Auto-save** — every change writes to `usePartySession` immediately (no Confirm)
- **All / Partial** toggle; partial → per-item checkboxes
- **Unchecked items = 0 THB** for that member; row amount updates in realtime
- Click name again → collapse panel
- Delete with confirm dialog

### Summary (`/summary`)

- **Party Name** input (top of first card) — bound to `session.partyName`
- **Bill split overview** — stacked proportional bar (all members) + legend
- Live payer rows with **per-member share bar** (% updates in realtime from session)
- Live payer rows from `computePayerAmounts` (no Calculate button)
- **Digital slip** — metadata, member totals, optional slip image
- **Confirm & share** → `POST /party/confirm` (FormData); on success clears items/members but **keeps party name**
- Back → `/members`

