## 7. Environment Variables

### Frontend

| Variable | Local | Production (Vercel) | Purpose |
|----------|-------|---------------------|---------|
| `NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL` | `http://localhost:4000` | `https://<service>.onrender.com` | Backend URL for `next.config` rewrites only; browser calls `/api/*` |

### Backend

| Variable | Local | Production (Render) | Purpose |
|----------|-------|---------------------|---------|
| `DATABASE_URL` | `postgresql://...@localhost:5432/...` | Supabase connection string | Prisma → PostgreSQL |
| `FRONTEND_URL` | `http://localhost:3000` | `https://<app>.vercel.app` | CORS + post-login redirect |
| `GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID` / `GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET` | dev credentials | production OAuth client | Google login |
| `GOOGLE_CALLBACK_URL` | `http://localhost:4000/auth/google/callback` | `https://<app>.vercel.app/api/auth/google/callback` | OAuth callback (via Vercel proxy) |
| `JWT_ACCESS_SECRET` / `JWT_REFRESH_SECRET` | dev secrets | long random strings | JWT signing |
| `COOKIE_SAME_SITE` | `lax` | `none` | Cross-site cookie attribute (still `none` with proxy) |
| `PORT` | `4000` | set by Render | HTTP listen port |

